N:Written in the bass clef in the book; two bars make the unit and the rhythm is 2+3+3+2, which Fox Strangways says no barring reproduces. Sung a man's voice down; sing it an octave up for children. Check: bar 2's "now" (a minim in the plate, read here as a crotchet) and the last bar's rest.
